cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Irradiance Calculator: laser setting to irradiance, photon flux and dose at the sample plane"
version: 1.0.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/derekthirstrup/microscope-irradiance"
abstract: >-
  Converts microscope laser power settings (%) into irradiance (mW/cm2), photon flux
  (photons cm-2 s-1) and dose (J/cm2 and photons/cm2) at the sample plane, from an
  Argolight ArgoPower export or hand-entered power-meter readings. Written for the
  QUAREP-LiMi irradiance measurement guidelines.
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - irradiance
  - photon flux
  - phototoxicity
  - QUAREP-LiMi
authors:
  - family-names: Thirstrup
    given-names: Derek
